{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "3accc87f-b82d-4816-a38e-59da66c74014",
    "name": "C-Shield - Edge (Nexus Vision)",
    "description": "Collection do C-Shield (GS 2026.2). Variaveis: url = IP elastico da EC2; device_id/entity_id = o C-Shield a operar. Ordem para colocar um C-Shield no ar: 1) Service group (uma vez), 2) Provisionar device, 3) Subscriptions do STH. O C-Shield so ENVIA dados: nao ha pasta de comandos nem registration. Todo request ao Orion/IoT Agent/STH leva os headers fiware-service e fiware-servicepath; GET nao leva Content-Type. Eventos de cartao NFC: releasedBy/releaseCount (liberacao) e refusedBy/refusedReason/refusalCount (recusa).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. IoT Agent MQTT",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://{{url}}:4041/iot/about",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": [
                "{{url}}"
              ],
              "port": "4041",
              "path": [
                "iot",
                "about"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Criar service group",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "fiware-service",
                "value": "smart"
              },
              {
                "key": "fiware-servicepath",
                "value": "/"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://{{url}}:4041/iot/services",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": [
                "{{url}}"
              ],
              "port": "4041",
              "path": [
                "iot",
                "services"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"services\": [\n    {\n      \"apikey\": \"TEF\",\n      \"cbroker\": \"http://{{url}}:1026\",\n      \"entity_type\": \"Thing\",\n      \"resource\": \"\",\n      \"timestamp\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "timestamp:true preenche TimeInstant a cada medicao (necessario para detectar offline). 409 se ja existir."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar service groups",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "fiware-service",
                "value": "smart"
              },
              {
                "key": "fiware-servicepath",
                "value": "/"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://{{url}}:4041/iot/services",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": [
                "{{url}}"
              ],
              "port": "4041",
              "path": [
                "iot",
                "services"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Provisionar device (usa device_id/entity_id)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "fiware-service",
                "value": "smart"
              },
              {
                "key": "fiware-servicepath",
                "value": "/"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://{{url}}:4041/iot/devices",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": [
                "{{url}}"
              ],
              "port": "4041",
              "path": [
                "iot",
                "devices"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"devices\": [\n    {\n      \"device_id\": \"{{device_id}}\",\n      \"entity_name\": \"{{entity_id}}\",\n      \"entity_type\": \"CShield\",\n      \"protocol\": \"PDI-IoTA-UltraLight\",\n      \"transport\": \"MQTT\",\n      \"attributes\": [\n        {\n          \"object_id\": \"t\",\n          \"name\": \"temperature\",\n          \"type\": \"Float\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"object_id\": \"h\",\n          \"name\": \"humidity\",\n          \"type\": \"Float\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"object_id\": \"l\",\n          \"name\": \"luminosity\",\n          \"type\": \"Integer\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"object_id\": \"sp\",\n          \"name\": \"setpoint\",\n          \"type\": \"Float\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"object_id\": \"dg\",\n          \"name\": \"defrost\",\n          \"type\": \"Integer\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"object_id\": \"st\",\n          \"name\": \"state\",\n          \"type\": \"Text\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"object_id\": \"mt\",\n          \"name\": \"reason\",\n          \"type\": \"Text\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"object_id\": \"bq\",\n          \"name\": \"blocks\",\n          \"type\": \"Integer\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"object_id\": \"ex\",\n          \"name\": \"exposure\",\n          \"type\": \"Float\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"object_id\": \"lb\",\n          \"name\": \"releasedBy\",\n          \"type\": \"Text\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"object_id\": \"nl\",\n          \"name\": \"releaseCount\",\n          \"type\": \"Integer\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"object_id\": \"rj\",\n          \"name\": \"refusedBy\",\n          \"type\": \"Text\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"object_id\": \"rm\",\n          \"name\": \"refusedReason\",\n          \"type\": \"Text\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"object_id\": \"nr\",\n          \"name\": \"refusalCount\",\n          \"type\": \"Integer\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Espera 201. So atributos: o C-Shield envia dados e NAO recebe comandos, entao nao ha 'commands' nem registration. lb/nl e rj/rm/nr so aparecem no payload quando um cartao NFC e lido (liberacao ou recusa). Se o device ja existir (409), apague-o antes (request 'Apagar device') para a lista nova de atributos valer."
          }
        },
